{"title": "Ice Cube", "pageid": 50812, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ice_Cube", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ice_Cube.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Ice_Cube.webp/300px-Ice_Cube.webp, /w/images/0/0e/Ice_Cube.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Ice Cube image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Ice_Cube.webp/300px-Ice_Cube.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Ice_Cube.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>An <b>Ice Cube</b> is large block of ice created by a <a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_the_Four_Elements\" title=\"Way of the Four Elements\">Way of the Four Elements</a> monk with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shaping_of_the_Ice\" title=\"Shaping of the Ice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp/20px-Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp/30px-Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp/40px-Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shaping of the Ice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp/20px-Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shaping_of_the_Ice\" title=\"Shaping of the Ice\">Shaping of the Ice</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>An enormous block of ice, created from nothing but the water in the air.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 200 kg (400 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 200 kg (400 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 0 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  0  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-5c7c65af8457dcc9END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7272956447afacaeEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">Monk_Ice_Cube</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Monk_Ice_Cube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Monk_Ice_Cube\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">408559c5-ac6c-4fab-b629-7fd6e52e108a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:408559c5-ac6c-4fab-b629-7fd6e52e108a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:408559c5-ac6c-4fab-b629-7fd6e52e108a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<ul><li>Climbable and destructible</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"25 hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 25 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a></li>\n<li>Resistances: <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Vulnerable to Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Piercing_Vulnerability.png/28px-Piercing_Vulnerability.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Piercing_Vulnerability.png/42px-Piercing_Vulnerability.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Piercing_Vulnerability.png/56px-Piercing_Vulnerability.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vulnerable to Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Piercing_Vulnerability.png/28px-Piercing_Vulnerability.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Piercing_Vulnerability.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Vulnerable to Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Vulnerability.png/28px-Thunder_Vulnerability.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Vulnerability.png/42px-Thunder_Vulnerability.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Vulnerability.png/56px-Thunder_Vulnerability.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vulnerable to Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Vulnerability.png/28px-Thunder_Vulnerability.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Vulnerability.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Necrotic_Immunity.png/28px-Necrotic_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Necrotic_Immunity.png/42px-Necrotic_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Necrotic_Immunity.png/56px-Necrotic_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Necrotic_Immunity.png/28px-Necrotic_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Necrotic_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Vulnerable to Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png/28px-Fire_Vulnerability.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png/42px-Fire_Vulnerability.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png/56px-Fire_Vulnerability.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vulnerable to Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png/28px-Fire_Vulnerability.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Fire_Vulnerability.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Cold_Immunity.png/28px-Cold_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Cold_Immunity.png/42px-Cold_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Cold_Immunity.png/56px-Cold_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Cold_Immunity.png/28px-Cold_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Cold_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/42px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/56px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/42px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/56px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Vulnerable to Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Force_Vulnerability.png/28px-Force_Vulnerability.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Force_Vulnerability.png/42px-Force_Vulnerability.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Force_Vulnerability.png/56px-Force_Vulnerability.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vulnerable to Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Force_Vulnerability.png/28px-Force_Vulnerability.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Force_Vulnerability.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Created with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shaping_of_the_Ice\" title=\"Shaping of the Ice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp/20px-Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp/30px-Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp/40px-Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shaping of the Ice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp/20px-Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Shaping_of_the_Ice_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shaping_of_the_Ice\" title=\"Shaping of the Ice\">Shaping of the Ice</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The ice is one cubic meter in size and can be stacked to create a climbable tower.</li>\n<li>It requires 17 <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/20px-Shove_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/30px-Shove_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/40px-Shove_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shove\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/20px-Shove_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">Shove</a> or otherwise move the ice cube due to its very high weight.</li>\n<li>It is too heavy to be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Thrown</a> normally as a 200 kg object would require 32 Strength to throw. It can be thrown with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/20px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/30px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/40px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Telekinesis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/20px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\">Telekinesis</a>, however, since that spell does not have a weight limit.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202410\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.077 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.081 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3076/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32635/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9389/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1303750/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.580      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   62.580      1 -total\n 49.23%   30.807     11 Template:Icon_text\n 46.08%   28.837     33 Template:Trim\n 31.46%   19.691      5 Template:SmSAI\n 27.85%   17.431      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 27.77%   17.376      1 Template:PageSeo\n 21.83%   13.661      6 Template:Icon_link\n 16.03%   10.034      2 Template:Uid\n 10.49%    6.564     11 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:50812-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202410 and revision id 387078. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}